  "sn45.30:1.2": "A wanderer named Uttiya appears in <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an10.95/en/sujato'>AN 10.95</a>, while a mendicant of the same name becomes an arahant in <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn47.16/en/sujato'>SN 47.16</a>. One might imagine these are the same person, were it not that verses are attributed to Uttiyas at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/thag1.30/en/sujato'>Thag 1.30</a>, <a href='https://suttacentral.net/thag1.54/en/sujato'>Thag 1.54</a>, and <a href='https://suttacentral.net/thag1.99/en/sujato'>Thag 1.99</a>. ",
